  "findings": [
    "All four previous unfinished episodes independently reproduce using the NNTrain bundled data, with pending-selection count0 and repeated Gotcha hand actions at turns32/14/18/30. Do not substitute docs/cards.json for deployed cards.json when reproducing.",
    "GreedyBot repeatedly selects the same playable Gotcha. Engine correctly permits activation/cancellation/refund; the policy reselects the active card and cycles. It exhausts its200-action budget without ending the turn, and the outer driver restarts that budget.",
    "The policy now skips active Gotcha when choosing hand plays. It can activate an inactive counter, then continue other actions/end its turn. Engine cancellation/refund behavior remains available and unchanged.",
    "Missing Red Devils/Ki-61 Hien classes have no direct reflected UField children and derive from BaseCardObject; base OnPlayedFromHand has empty script. This does not prove the complete event/native-default dispatch is a no-op. Captured generic helper virtual calls are not treated as card implementations. Both remain rejected."
  ],
